        "rows": [
          [
            "fixed",
            "`pubkit crates` tries each upgrade on its own, on top of those already kept, so one unaudited crate no longer costs the audited ones; it takes no MSRV downgrades, handles crates locked at several versions, and gives each skipped crate its own reason (no audit, with what cargo vet recommends; cargo deny; or updatable only together with others)"
